#. Hexadecimal escapes describe encoded bytes, not Unicode code points.
msgctxt "hex.bytes"
msgid "\xC3\xA9 route"
msgstr "\xE2\x98\x83 marker"

#. Octal escapes use the same byte-oriented UTF-8 grammar.
